'bourgeois-chateau-mongravey|2019':{src:'FT-Ch-Mongravey-2019-GB.pdf',months:'14',oak:60,window:'maintenant jusqu’en 2030.» «Shows the caressing, enticing profile of the vintage, with plum sauce and raspberry pâte de fruit notes carried by a velvety structure. Features hints of singed alder and lilac on the finish. Cabernet Sauvignon, Merlot and Cabernet Franc.',yld:50},
